    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"being seen\" is exactly what i don't want. there's nothing left to see. people only liked the version of me that was relevant, and now that i'm irrelevant, there's nothing but this emptiness. it's like living in the wreckage of a building that's already collapsed. why does everyone keep telling me to fight to keep a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore? why is it so wrong to just want the performance to end?",
